db/image/upload/t_thumb/sci2u9.jpg"}], "slug": "a-rats-quest-the-way-back-home", "storyline": "Mat is a young male rat that lives among a rat commune in an abandoned wine cellar, together with his best friend Toby and other rodents. Having felt in love with Nat, a female house mouse kept as a pet in the upper floors, he decides to become a Scavenger, for sneaking to his beloved somehow officially. Being from different worlds, they plot a plan to escape to \u201cthe outside\u201d together. His overconfidence however puts them in peril\u2019s way, and not everything in the commune is as it seems.\n\nIn a series of unlucky events, Mat finds himself alone, far away from the house. He must make his way back home, overcoming a journey across woodlands, caves, and swamps, defying overwhelming danger of a winged, poisonous, and scale-bond variety. With a rivet for a sword and nails as throwing daggers, Mat will brave a world to which he is unwelcome.", "summary": "Follow Mat, the Scavenger, on his long journey to find his way back home. Experience a world full of threats from a rat's unique perspective, while fighting and sneaking on a rodent's most dangerous adventure.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-rats-quest-the-way-back-home", "videos": [{"id": 95600, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "B8Opp_AL5Cg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8Opp_AL5Cg", "title": "A Rat's Quest - The Way Back Home | Teaser 2 [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B8Opp_AL5Cg/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 95601, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Zw95Rfjz1kc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zw95Rfjz1kc", "title": "A Rat's Quest - The Way Back Home | Teaser 1 [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zw95Rfjz1kc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 95602, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "s8sWbwGtSyY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s8sWbwGtSyY", "title": "A Rat's Quest - The Way back Home // Brothers in Mischief Teas